All `_minutes` fields are integers (no quotes, no units, no arithmetic).
`transition_cue` on the last concept and `homework` may be `null`.
Never emit a bare token such as `<int>`, `<string>`, `TBD`, or `...` — such output
is not valid JSON and the plan will be rejected.

